   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Concrete next steps",
   "text": "Contact the International Niemann-Pick Disease Alliance (INPDA), a patient group based in the UK that the atlas links to Niemann-Pick A [Ef2a2426]. Contact the National Niemann-Pick Disease Foundation, Inc. (NNPDF), a patient group based in the US that the atlas links to Niemann-Pick A [E0d1f519]. Ask whether the GM1 Matrix, a patient registry already used for the related disease GM1 gangliosidosis (infantile form), could include or be copied for Niemann-Pick A, since Niemann-Pick A does not yet have one of its own [Ea9bb267].",
